        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Guang bam the guang daimei,",
            "Makge kamei kum kandih khou;",
            "Njangmei guange Guang daimei,",
            "Thuan o (2) Hosana guang daimei ta.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Thuan o guang dailiangmei puhta,",
            "Thuan o halleluijah;",
            "Njangmei guange guang daimei,",
            "Thuan o (2) guang daimei puhta.",
            "",
            "2. Jat kapumma )_3 thuan kandiu,",
            "Khouring khounah kapumma ni;",
            "Kamei thai pui lu )_3 thuan diu,",
            "Thuan o (2) Hosana guang daimei ta.",
            "",
            "3. Katik kagun dailiang kandiu,",
            "Sangai liangmmei guang Hosana;",
            "Neila dikho Zion nah guai,",
            "Thuan o (2) Hosana guang daimei ta.",
            "Favourite song: Hiamthui Kamei"
          ]
        }
      },
